RipsConduit_EnterRip
├── when the payment covers every requested entry
│   ├── it should credit the entries to the recipient.
│   └── it should leave no balance in the conduit.
├── when requested entries exceed available entries
│   ├── it should purchase only the available entries for the recipient.
│   ├── it should forward the excess to the recipient.
│   └── it should emit an {ExcessForwarded} event.
├── when the conduit holds a stranded balance
│   └── it should forward the stranded balance along with the excess.
└── when the recipient rejects native currency
    └── it should revert.
